Energistics PropertyKind dictionary (crate energyml-domain)
-----------------------------------------------------------
crates/energyml-domain/data/property_kinds.tsv is a compact, tab-separated form
(uuid, title, parent, quantity class, abstract flag, deprecation date,
description) of the Energistics PropertyKindDictionary v2.3 (eml 2.3). The
Energistics standards, or any portion thereof, remain the property of
Energistics Consortium, Inc. and are subject to the Energistics Product License
Agreement (https://www.energistics.org/product-license-agreement). Energistics(R)
is a trademark or registered trademark of Energistics Consortium, Inc. The
provenance of the file is in crates/energyml-domain/data/property_kinds.NOTICE.md.

BRGM GeolTs chronostratigraphic chart (crate energyml-domain)
-------------------------------------------------------------
crates/energyml-domain/data/geolts/ holds exports of the GeolTs and GeolTsBound
registers.
Attribution: BRGM - GeolTs.
Source: https://data.geoscience.fr/ncl/GeolTs
